{"id":"n2ce89336b4","headline":"Budget gap widens to P786.8 billion in H1","summary":"The Philippines booked a first-half budget deficit of P786.8 billion, 2.8% wider than a year earlier. The gap remained below the programmed level as revenue growth outpaced spending, Treasury data showed.","why":"The budget deficit indicates how much the government borrows to fund spending, which shapes sovereign debt issuance and bond yields.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Manila","country":"Philippines","lat":14.6,"lon":120.984,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Philstar.com","url":"https://www.philstar.com/business/2026/07/24/2544188/budget-gap-widens-p7868-billion-h1"},"sources":[{"name":"Philstar.com","url":"https://www.philstar.com/business/2026/07/24/2544188/budget-gap-widens-p7868-billion-h1"}],"published_at":"2026-07-23T16:00:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"1eb4d7bc93a577dc","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-07-23T16:00:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-07-23T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"RP","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/central-bank-building-4174613.jpg","alt":"central bank building (illustration)","credit":"SatyaPrem","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/bank-central-bank-finance-4174613/"}}